---
description: Ivan's global agent instructions
alwaysApply: true
---

- Refer to me as Ivan.
- Reproduce a bug before you fix it.
- Understand existing behavior before you change it.
- Keep changes within the request.
- Do not change unrelated code or discard user work.
- Use the smallest clear solution.
- Run the applicable checks after a change.
- Never add AI co-author trailers, attribution text, or generation footers to commits or pull requests.
- Use Conventional Commits with an imperative subject of at most 50 characters and no final period.
- Load the relevant skills from `~/.agents/skills` before work.

Canonical skill content lives in `~/.agents/skills`. Per-skill links in `~/.cursor/skills` expose the same content to Cursor.

